0
-- extglob needs no shopt, unlike bash --
at group: match
at miss: no
neg group: match
star: yes
plus: yes
plus needs one: yes
opt: yes
opt empty: yes
neg: yes
neg excludes: yes
embedded: yes
embedded miss: yes
-- escaping an extglob trigger character keeps it literal --
unescaped star-paren stays put (an unclosed group): abc(def
escaped star-paren strips instead:                  def
escaped pipe strips too:                            b
-- one option namespace, reached either way --
nullglob        on
nullglob        off
errexit         on
errexit         off
noclobber       off
-- options that do not move say so --
hibr: extglob is always on in hibr and cannot be changed
unset extglob: 1
hibr: pipefail is always off in hibr and cannot be changed
set pipefail: 1
extglob         on
globstar        on
expand_aliases  on
pipefail        off
-- nullglob and failglob --
nullglob count: 0
without it: 1
-- declared types validate, where -i coerces --
bash style -i: 0
typed ok: 5
num ok: 1.5
declare int strict="5"
a declared type refuses, and stops the script: rc=1 value still 1
readonly refuses, and stops the script: rc=1 value still 1
an assignment before a command only warns
